<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - INBRAND cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - INBRAND cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robinson-Humphrey said it cut INBRAND Corp's near- and long-term ratings to market perform from buy.</p>
<p>-- INBRAND drops 8 to 12 in morning trading.</p>
<p>-- On Wednesday, INBRAND posted second quarter earnings of $0.18 a share on sales of $57.8 million, compared with earnings of $0.11 a share on sales of $27.0 million last year.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>	  (( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
